{"shortDescription":"Cathie Wood’s Ark Invest made several large portfolio moves last week, adding to CoreWeave NASDAQ:CRWV while increasing exposure to healthcare and trimming positions across crypto, genomics and technology.In AI and cloud infrastructure, Ark bought ~239K shares of CoreWeave NASDAQ:CRWV worth about…","astDescription":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"p","children":["Cathie Wood’s Ark Invest made several large portfolio moves last week, adding to CoreWeave ",{"type":"symbol","params":{"symbol":"NASDAQ:CRWV","text":"NASDAQ:CRWV"}}," while increasing exposure to healthcare and trimming positions across crypto, genomics and technology."]},{"type":"p","children":["In AI and cloud infrastructure, Ark bought ~239K shares of CoreWeave ",{"type":"symbol","params":{"symbol":"NASDAQ:CRWV","text":"NASDAQ:CRWV"}}," worth about $24.7M, while adding around 11K shares of Meta Platforms ",{"type":"symbol","params":{"symbol":"NASDAQ:META","text":"NASDAQ:META"}}," for $7.25M. The firm also sold ~87K shares of Tempus AI ",{"type":"symbol","params":{"symbol":"NASDAQ:TEM","text":"NASDAQ:TEM"}}," worth $5.2M and 34.5K shares of Palantir Technologies ",{"type":"symbol","params":{"symbol":"NASDAQ:PLTR","text":"NASDAQ:PLTR"}}," for $5.9M."]},{"type":"p","children":["In healthcare and biotechnology, Ark bought Ionis Pharmaceuticals ",{"type":"symbol","params":{"symbol":"NASDAQ:IONS","text":"NASDAQ:IONS"}}," for about $8.90M and Guardant Health ",{"type":"symbol","params":{"symbol":"NASDAQ:GH","text":"NASDAQ:GH"}}," for $9.3M. It also made a smaller addition to Scribe Therapeutics ",{"type":"symbol","params":{"symbol":"NASDAQ:SCTX","text":"NASDAQ:SCTX"}},". On the selling side, the firm cut ~322K shares in 10x Genomics ",{"type":"symbol","params":{"symbol":"NASDAQ:TXG","text":"NASDAQ:TXG"}}," by $21.8M, Illumina ",{"type":"symbol","params":{"symbol":"NASDAQ:ILMN","text":"NASDAQ:ILMN"}}," by $1.9M and GeneDx Holdings ",{"type":"symbol","params":{"symbol":"NASDAQ:WGS","text":"NASDAQ:WGS"}}," by $2M."]},{"type":"p","children":["In crypto and fintech, Ark sold 1.53M shares of the ARK 21Shares Bitcoin ETF ",{"type":"symbol","params":{"symbol":"CBOE:ARKB","text":"CBOE:ARKB"}}," worth about $39.8M, marking its largest sale of the week. The firm also reduced Circle Internet ",{"type":"symbol","params":{"symbol":"NYSE:CRCL","text":"NYSE:CRCL"}}," by $13.5M, Coinbase Global ",{"type":"symbol","params":{"symbol":"NASDAQ:COIN","text":"NASDAQ:COIN"}}," by $6.8M and a smaller reduction in Bullish ",{"type":"symbol","params":{"symbol":"NYSE:BLSH","text":"NYSE:BLSH"}},"."]},{"type":"p","children":["In other technology holdings, Ark sold Advanced Micro Devices ",{"type":"symbol","params":{"symbol":"NASDAQ:AMD","text":"NASDAQ:AMD"}}," worth ~$10M, Alphabet ",{"type":"symbol","params":{"symbol":"NASDAQ:GOOG","text":"NASDAQ:GOOG"}}," by $13.1M, and Shopify ",{"type":"symbol","params":{"symbol":"NASDAQ:SHOP","text":"NASDAQ:SHOP"}}," by $6.5M. It also made a smaller reduction to Twist Bioscience ",{"type":"symbol","params":{"symbol":"NASDAQ:TWST","text":"NASDAQ:TWST"}},"."]},{"type":"p","children":["In aerospace and defense, Ark bought AeroVironment ",{"type":"symbol","params":{"symbol":"NASDAQ:AVAV","text":"NASDAQ:AVAV"}}," worth $5.8M. The firm also sold Teledyne Technologies ",{"type":"symbol","params":{"symbol":"NYSE:TDY","text":"NYSE:TDY"}}," for $3.3M and Iridium Communications ",{"type":"symbol","params":{"symbol":"NASDAQ:IRDM","text":"NASDAQ:IRDM"}}," for $3.7M. Other portfolio activity included a smaller reduction in Brera Holdings ",{"type":"symbol","params":{"symbol":"NASDAQ:SLMT","text":"NASDAQ:SLMT"}},"."]},{"type":"p","children":[{"type":"disclaimer","children":["Content provided by Seeking Alpha is intended for information purposes only, and that Seeking Alpha does not offer any personalist investment advice and is not a licensed securities dealer, broker, US investment adviser or investment bank."]}]}]},"language":"en","tags":[{"title":"Cr